        "text": "Oral argument before the Supreme Court was held on Monday, January 14, 2008 at 11:06\u202fa.m."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "eb41cb581fc64cce0ecb96f4f806d61dfcc2d6e744a85a4e4480a75739752065",
