        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the contract at issue explicitly requires that any dispute over its validity or legality be resolved through arbitration."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "eb41cb581fc64cce0ecb96f4f806d61dfcc2d6e744a85a4e4480a75739752065",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-eb41cb581fc6-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The petitioner warns that if the decision stands, it could trigger a wave of state\u2011law rulings that would eliminate arbitration in whole categories of cases."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "eb41cb581fc64cce0ecb96f4f806d61dfcc2d6e744a85a4e4480a75739752065",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-eb41cb581fc6-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A motion to compel arbitration was filed but was denied based on statutory provision 1700.44."
      }
